{
  "_meta": {
    "title": "Trajectory Motion (Wan-Move)",
    "description": "Core ComfyUI nodes only, wired from the official video_wanmove_480p template. Wan2.1 Wan-Move 14B fp8 (KJ) + lightx2v I2V 480p cfg/step-distill LoRA (6 steps, er_sde/simple, CFG 1, shift 8), clip_vision_h on the start photo. The builder writes named trajectory presets as pixel track lists (JSON) into the string node; WanMoveTracksFromCoords turns them into tracks that drag the image content along those paths. 16 fps, ~480p."
  },
